# Optional. When set, the group class sign-up form on /classes will POST
# each registration to this URL (a Google Apps Script Web App — see
# docs/google-apps-script.gs for how to deploy one, and README.md for
# where to set this for the deployed site). Left unset, the form still
# works exactly as before: it validates, shows a success message, and
# resets, without recording anything anywhere.
VITE_GROUP_REGISTRATION_ENDPOINT=
